1
00:00:00,397 --> 00:00:04,567
(Sheldon:)How could you for a moment think
that my favorite amino acid is glutamine?

2
00:00:06,570 --> 00:00:08,570
- He had lysine but changed it.
- Yeah.

3
00:00:08,738 --> 00:00:11,078
Should have, would have,
could have, Raj.

4
00:00:13,910 --> 00:00:15,660
I like to floss before I eat...

5
00:00:15,829 --> 00:00:18,919
(Kripke:)...so my gum pockets
are open for new food.

6
00:00:19,875 --> 00:00:20,915
(Kripke:)Ew.

7
00:00:22,711 --> 00:00:24,671
(Sheldon(on phone):)Hello.

8
00:00:26,256 --> 00:00:28,466
(Kripke:)How did I walk past you?

9
00:00:28,633 --> 00:00:29,763
I'm Barry.

10
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:32,760
(Scene:)- Penny.
- Eh, that's not a very hot name.

11
00:00:34,264 --> 00:00:36,094
I'm gonna call you "Roxanne."

12
00:00:37,684 --> 00:00:38,934
(Kripke:)Ooh, pot stickers.

13
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:43,020
(Howard:)Suddenly, I'm looking pretty good, huh?

14
00:00:46,443 --> 00:00:49,573
(Sheldon:)So, uh, Kripke,
I was wondering if there's any chance...

15
00:00:49,738 --> 00:00:52,908
(Sheldon:)...you could get me some time
on the Open Science Grid computer?

16
00:00:53,074 --> 00:00:54,534
(Leonard:)No.

17
00:00:54,701 --> 00:00:55,781
(Sheldon:)No?

18
00:00:55,952 --> 00:00:57,282
(Sheldon:)But we're friends.

19
00:00:57,996 --> 00:01:02,126
I'm sorry. No, my friend.

